{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56783","headline":"绿珠作诗 · 不详","name":"绿珠作诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"此日人非昔日人，笛声空怨赵王伦。\n红残翠碎花楼下，金谷千年更不春。\n见《太平广记》卷四八九引。\n今人汪辟疆《唐人小说》本系据《顾氏文房小说》本校录，今据以校异文。\n（按：《周秦行纪》作者，《太平广记》署「牛僧孺撰」，後人已证定爲韦瓘作，今从之。\n《全唐诗续补遗》卷八将第六首收归牛僧孺名下，未谛，今重录之。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56783.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56783","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}